items.summary:
🇺🇦❗️Ukraine seeks to receive 100-120 missiles for Patriot every month and plans to deploy its own FREYJA anti-missile system as early as December, – Zelensky.
​
▪️Russia currently produces about 140 ballistic missiles per month. To guarantee the destruction of such a number, according to NATO rules, it is necessary to have twice as many interceptors – 280 missiles;
▪️At the same time, even receiving 100 missiles per month remains an extremely difficult task;
▪️Ukraine seeks to receive 100-120 missiles for Patriot during the coldest months from US stocks and production, from European countries and partners in the Middle East;
▪️In parallel, Ukraine, together with companies from ten countries, is developing its own FREYJA anti-missile system;
▪️The main part of this system is the launcher and the missile. We have them. This is Ukrainian production.
Video

